# Repo-root safety net — closes docs/THREAT_MODEL.md T-003 ("no .gitignore" finding from the
# Phase 0 audit). app/web/ has its own more specific .gitignore for that package; this file
# catches stray secrets/editor artifacts anywhere else in the repo and is a second line of
# defense even where a package-level .gitignore already covers something.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!*/.env.example

*.pem
*.key

.DS_Store
*.log

node_modules/
